            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present disclosure relates to a user device, a base station, and data transmission and reception methods to be performed by a user device and a base station in a communications 5 system. The user device comprises circuitry which, in operation, receives paging occasion configuration from the base station, including at least one parameter for configuring a predefined time-domain pattern for receiving paging occasion within a paging cycle; and performs reception of paging signal in the paging occasions within the predefined time-domain pattern configured according to the received paging occasion configuration.</p>
            </abstract>
